<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AlliedSignal said on list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AlliedSignal said on list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs upgraded AlliedSignal Inc to the firm's priority list from its recommended list, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-3/4 to 72-3/4.</p>
